{'symbol': 'WLTW', 'date': '2021-11-02 18:15:00', 'title': 'WILLIS TOWERS WATSON APPOINTS HEAD OF NEW ZEALAND', 'text': 'AUCKLAND, NEW ZEALAND, NOV. 02, 2021 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- WILLIS TOWERS WATSON (NASDAQ:WLTW), A LEADING GLOBAL ADVISORY, BROKING, AND SOLUTIONS COMPANY, TODAY ANNOUNCED THE APPOINTMENT OF MICHAEL BROWN AS HEAD OF NEW ZEALAND, BASED IN AUCKLAND.'}